summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">OBJ_Potion_Of_Invulnerability</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:OBJ_Potion_Of_Invulnerability+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:OBJ_Potion_Of_Invulnerability+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"> <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> </span>\nGain <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Types\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Types\">Resistance</a> to all damage for 10 rounds. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Invulnerability\"> Condition: Invulnerability </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerability_(Condition)\" title=\"Invulnerability (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Invulnerability_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Invulnerability_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Invulnerability_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Invulnerability_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Invulnerability_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Invulnerability_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invulnerability\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Invulnerability_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Invulnerability_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/70/Invulnerability_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerability_(Condition)\" title=\"Invulnerability (Condition)\">Invulnerability</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 10  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Resistant\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistant\">Resistant</a> to all damage.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Sold by the following merchants:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Skittle\" title=\"Skittle\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Portrait_Skittle.png/25px-Portrait_Skittle.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Portrait_Skittle.png/38px-Portrait_Skittle.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Portrait_Skittle.png/50px-Portrait_Skittle.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Skittle\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Portrait_Skittle.png/25px-Portrait_Skittle.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Portrait_Skittle.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Skittle\" title=\"Skittle\">Skittle</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Heapside_Prison\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Heapside Prison\">Heapside Prison</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vicar_Humbletoes\" title=\"Vicar Humbletoes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Humbletoes.png/25px-Portrait_Humbletoes.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Humbletoes.png/38px-Portrait_Humbletoes.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Humbletoes.png/50px-Portrait_Humbletoes.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vicar Humbletoes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Humbletoes.png/25px-Portrait_Humbletoes.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Portrait_Humbletoes.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vicar_Humbletoes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vicar Humbletoes\">Vicar Humbletoes</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/Stormshore_Tabernacle\" title=\"Stormshore Tabernacle\">Stormshore Tabernacle</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Crafted via <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemy</a> by combining <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vitriol_of_Divine_Miasma\" title=\"Vitriol of Divine Miasma\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Vitriol_of_Divine_Miasma_Item_Icon.png/20px-Vitriol_of_Divine_Miasma_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Vitriol_of_Divine_Miasma_Item_Icon.png/30px-Vitriol_of_Divine_Miasma_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Vitriol_of_Divine_Miasma_Item_Icon.png/40px-Vitriol_of_Divine_Miasma_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Vitriol_of_Divine_Miasma_Item_Icon.png/20px-Vitriol_of_Divine_Miasma_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Vitriol_of_Divine_Miasma_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vitriol_of_Divine_Miasma\" title=\"Vitriol of Divine Miasma\">Vitriol of Divine Miasma</a> (procured from <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Bone_Shard\" title=\"Divine Bone Shard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Divine_Bone_Shard_Item_Icon.png/20px-Divine_Bone_Shard_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Divine_Bone_Shard_Item_Icon.png/30px-Divine_Bone_Shard_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Divine_Bone_Shard_Item_Icon.png/40px-Divine_Bone_Shard_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Divine_Bone_Shard_Item_Icon.png/20px-Divine_Bone_Shard_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Divine_Bone_Shard_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Bone_Shard\" title=\"Divine Bone Shard\">Divine Bone Shard</a>) and any <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy#Extractions\" title=\"Alchemy\">Sublimate</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Despite having \"Elixir\" in the name, this item behaves like a regular <a href=\"/wiki/Potion\" title=\"Potion\">Potion</a>:\n<ul><li>Its effect lasts only 10 rounds</li>\n<li>Its effect does not overwrite other elixirs</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 111.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 109.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance_Model.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"In-game model\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance_Model.png/164px-Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance_Model.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance_Model.png/246px-Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance_Model.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance_Model.png/327px-Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance_Model.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"In-game model\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance_Model.png/164px-Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance_Model.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance_Model.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">In-game model</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714194943\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.082 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.088 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3127/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 45309/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11332/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion